      <documentation>End-to-end example: a team member asks the AI agent to build/modify a diagram, the agent searches the knowledge base for relevant guidance before acting, then calls a BPMN tool informed by that guidance, which updates the live diagram open in the Modeler — with the result flowing back to the agent and then the team member.</documentation>
